		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=718#comment-14259</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[What a spirit Geraldine had!  She was one of the most remarkable people I&#039;ve ever met and I have so many wonderful memories of her.  I still think of her often and will be forever grateful for her friendship.  She may be out of the body but will never be forgotten by her many friends.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>What a spirit Geraldine had!  She was one of the most remarkable people I&#8217;ve ever met and I have so many wonderful memories of her.  I still think of her often and will be forever grateful for her friendship.  She may be out of the body but will never be forgotten by her many friends.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
	<item>
		<title>By: Jeanne Field</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=718&#038;cpage=1#comment-14098</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jeanne Field]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 27 Jan 2013 01:30:44 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=718#comment-14098</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Today, I was making a pasta sauce and into my head came the very clear voice of Geraldine saying, Put a cover on it.  The flavors won&#039;t blend if it&#039;s not covered.  
She approached life that way too.  How do we bring all of our senses and energy to the circle and let it mix with all that&#039;s there?
I wish I could call her.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Today, I was making a pasta sauce and into my head came the very clear voice of Geraldine saying, Put a cover on it.  The flavors won&#8217;t blend if it&#8217;s not covered.<br />
She approached life that way too.  How do we bring all of our senses and energy to the circle and let it mix with all that&#8217;s there?<br />
I wish I could call her.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
	<item>
		<title>By: Jakob Hedin</title>
